{"version":2,"slug":"slow-english-listening-for-beginners-not-boring","videoId":"MOu8MwBosTc","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/MOu8MwBosTc","lang":"en","title":"Slow English Listening for Beginners (not boring)","category":"Travelling","channel":"English by Jay - Sprout","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@englishbyjay.official","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Slow english","simple english learn"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"In this slow English video,"},{"start":3,"text":"I'm going to show you English using the"},{"start":6,"text":"world around me."},{"start":8,"text":"I'll show you how to speak about your"},{"start":12,"text":"hobbies,"},{"start":14,"text":"how to ask someone about their hobbies,"},{"start":18,"text":"and finally, I will show you a very"},{"start":21,"text":"powerful speaking exercise that only"},{"start":25,"text":"takes 1 minute a day."},{"start":34,"text":"This is a Frisbee."},{"start":38,"text":"I"},{"start":39,"text":"am throwing"},{"start":41,"text":"the Frisbee."},{"start":42,"text":"And I am catching it."},{"start":48,"text":"I just caught the Frisbee."},{"start":51,"text":"Now, to talk about your hobbies, you can"},{"start":54,"text":"say, \"I like playing Frisbee.\""},{"start":57,"text":"\"I enjoy playing Frisbee.\" Or"},{"start":61,"text":"the very native way,"},{"start":63,"text":"\"I'm into Frisbee.\""},{"start":66,"text":"You say \"I'm into something\" when you"},{"start":69,"text":"really enjoy doing it."},{"start":72,"text":"You really like doing it."},{"start":76,"text":"I am into Frisbee."},{"start":82,"text":"I love it."},{"start":85,"text":"Now,"},{"start":87,"text":"all of this Frisbee is making me"},{"start":92,"text":"thirsty."},{"start":98,"text":"This is"},{"start":100,"text":"a coconut."},{"start":102,"text":"There is a straw"},{"start":105,"text":"inside"},{"start":108,"text":"the coconut."},{"start":111,"text":"I am sipping the coconut."},{"start":117,"text":"That's"},{"start":119,"text":"refreshing."},{"start":121,"text":"Coconuts are one of my favorite fruits."},{"start":127,"text":"I'm a big fan of coconuts."},{"start":131,"text":"When you say"},{"start":133,"text":"I'm a big fan of something,"},{"start":136,"text":"it means that you really, really like"},{"start":140,"text":"it."},{"start":142,"text":"I"},{"start":143,"text":"I'm a big fan"},{"start":145,"text":"of coconuts."},{"start":147,"text":"I love them."},{"start":149,"text":"Now,"},{"start":150,"text":"it's time to get changed."},{"start":154,"text":"And I"},{"start":155,"text":"I'm going to get changed into my"},{"start":161,"text":"trunks."},{"start":163,"text":"These"},{"start":165,"text":"are red trunks."},{"start":167,"text":"And"},{"start":168,"text":"I am tying"},{"start":170,"text":"a knot."},{"start":173,"text":"I'm tying the string."},{"start":178,"text":"Now,"},{"start":179,"text":"I'm going to go swimming."},{"start":183,"text":"I'm going to go"},{"start":186,"text":"swimming."},{"start":188,"text":"Let's go."},{"start":189,"text":"I'm running on the sand to the ocean."},{"start":196,"text":"Ready?"},{"start":200,"text":"Hello."},{"start":201,"text":"I'm underwater."},{"start":207,"text":"In the distance, you can see the"},{"start":209,"text":"mountains."},{"start":211,"text":"This line is called the horizon."},{"start":216,"text":"And where the ocean meets the sand is"},{"start":219,"text":"called the shore."},{"start":224,"text":"This is the shore."},{"start":233,"text":"Now,"},{"start":235,"text":"I am drying"},{"start":239,"text":"my hair"},{"start":241,"text":"with a towel."},{"start":243,"text":"This is a white towel."},{"start":247,"text":"I was just swimming,"},{"start":250,"text":"so"},{"start":251,"text":"my hair is wet."},{"start":255,"text":"I'm drying it"},{"start":257,"text":"with the towel."},{"start":258,"text":"That was a lovely swim."},{"start":262,"text":"I'm"},{"start":263,"text":"a big fan of swimming."},{"start":266,"text":"Do you like swimming?"},{"start":269,"text":"How do you ask somebody else about their"},{"start":273,"text":"hobbies?"},{"start":275,"text":"In England,"},{"start":276,"text":"we don't say, \"What are your hobbies?\""},{"start":279,"text":"that much."},{"start":281,"text":"We tend to word it slightly differently."},{"start":286,"text":"We would say,"},{"start":289,"text":"\"What do you do in your free time?\""},{"start":292,"text":"\"What do you do for fun?\""},{"start":295,"text":"\"What do you do when you're not"},{"start":297,"text":"working?\""},{"start":299,"text":"And finally, \"What are you into?\""},{"start":303,"text":"And my top tip, when somebody responds,"},{"start":307,"text":"when they answer"},{"start":309,"text":"your question,"},{"start":311,"text":"you can ask a follow-up question."},{"start":314,"text":"You can say,"},{"start":316,"text":"\"How did you get into that?\""},{"start":319,"text":"For example,"},{"start":320,"text":"\"What are you into?\""},{"start":322,"text":"I'm into videography,"},{"start":325,"text":"making videos."},{"start":328,"text":"\"How did you get into that?\""},{"start":330,"text":"Well, Mario,"},{"start":331,"text":"that's a good question."},{"start":333,"text":"I got into videography"},{"start":336,"text":"2 years ago,"},{"start":337,"text":"when I started making"},{"start":340,"text":"short-form videos."},{"start":343,"text":"Speaking of videos, now let's"},{"start":347,"text":"walk around"},{"start":349,"text":"and film some POV English. And POV is"},{"start":354,"text":"point of view."},{"start":361,"text":"Woohoo!"},{"start":363,"text":"POV by Jay."},{"start":366,"text":"This is a beanbag."},{"start":370,"text":"A blue beanbag."},{"start":372,"text":"Let's sit down."},{"start":375,"text":"Oh."},{"start":378,"text":"I am sitting in the beanbag"},{"start":382,"text":"and"},{"start":383,"text":"sunbathing."},{"start":385,"text":"The sun is shining."},{"start":389,"text":"I'm sunbathing in the beanbag."},{"start":393,"text":"Okay."},{"start":394,"text":"These are tents."},{"start":398,"text":"There are two"},{"start":399,"text":"white tents."},{"start":401,"text":"And these tents are for glamping."},{"start":405,"text":"Glamping is like fancy"},{"start":408,"text":"camping."},{"start":409,"text":"You have a bed"},{"start":412,"text":"and a lamp."},{"start":414,"text":"Glamping."},{"start":416,"text":"Fancy camping."},{"start":422,"text":"These are the showers."},{"start":424,"text":"And"},{"start":426,"text":"the part of the shower where the water"},{"start":429,"text":"comes out,"},{"start":431,"text":"this part,"},{"start":432,"text":"it's called the shower head."},{"start":437,"text":"And this is the tap."},{"start":439,"text":"If I turn on the tap, wait."},{"start":444,"text":"The water is coming out of the shower"},{"start":448,"text":"head."},{"start":450,"text":"And there is Trang."},{"start":452,"text":"Filming me"},{"start":453,"text":"with"},{"start":455,"text":"Let's show the camera."},{"start":457,"text":"Our camera. If you're interested, it's a"},{"start":460,"text":"Sony ZV-E1."},{"start":463,"text":"A beautiful thing."},{"start":470,"text":"Now,"},{"start":471,"text":"I'm walking down a small path"},{"start":474,"text":"and there are plants either side of me."},{"start":479,"text":"And now I'm coming out"},{"start":482,"text":"into the sun."},{"start":486,"text":"It's the weekend and everyone is"},{"start":488,"text":"chilling"},{"start":490,"text":"by the beach."},{"start":494,"text":"I'm lying"},{"start":496,"text":"on the grass."},{"start":499,"text":"And to my left,"},{"start":500,"text":"this is the mat."},{"start":504,"text":"I'm sunbathing."},{"start":507,"text":"The sun"},{"start":508,"text":"is very bright."},{"start":510,"text":"So, I'm squinting"},{"start":514,"text":"my eyes."},{"start":515,"text":"I'm squinting"},{"start":518,"text":"because the sun is bright."},{"start":521,"text":"Let's continue."},{"start":524,"text":"This is our mat."},{"start":528,"text":"Our white mat"},{"start":530,"text":"where we are sitting."},{"start":533,"text":"You can see"},{"start":534,"text":"my shadow."},{"start":537,"text":"You can see my shadow"},{"start":540,"text":"on the white mat."},{"start":542,"text":"This is a shadow."},{"start":544,"text":"Now,"},{"start":545,"text":"I'm going to go into the shade."},{"start":548,"text":"The shade."},{"start":552,"text":"Wow."},{"start":554,"text":"I'm cooling down in the shade."},{"start":557,"text":"The shade is a larger area"},{"start":561,"text":"with"},{"start":562,"text":"no sun."},{"start":564,"text":"I'm chilling in the shade."},{"start":567,"text":"If you love this POV style English, then"},{"start":572,"text":"I'm posting a brand new series on"},{"start":576,"text":"sproutlanguage.com."},{"start":578,"text":"I'll post a beginner POV video"},{"start":583,"text":"every Tuesday which will help beginners"},{"start":586,"text":"learn English through me showing you the"},{"start":590,"text":"world"},{"start":593,"text":"around."},{"start":594,"text":"After you watch the video,"},{"start":598,"text":"you can talk with JI."},{"start":601,"text":"JI is an AI version of me"},{"start":606,"text":"and he sounds"},{"start":608,"text":"just like me."},{"start":611,"text":"What part of the video did you find most"},{"start":615,"text":"interesting?"},{"start":616,"text":"You can talk with JI about the words"},{"start":620,"text":"that you learned in the video and he"},{"start":623,"text":"will ask you questions so you can"},{"start":627,"text":"practice your speaking in"},{"start":631,"text":"a relaxed, stress-free way. If you want"},{"start":635,"text":"to sign up,"},{"start":637,"text":"check the link in the description."},{"start":640,"text":"Now, let's play the JAM game."},{"start":645,"text":"This is the jam that we"},{"start":650,"text":"eat."},{"start":651,"text":"But, what about the JAM game?"},{"start":658,"text":"JAM stands for just a minute."},{"start":664,"text":"How do you play?"},{"start":665,"text":"Choose a"},{"start":667,"text":"random word"},{"start":669,"text":"or"},{"start":670,"text":"a random topic."},{"start":672,"text":"Set a timer for 1 minute and then"},{"start":678,"text":"talk. Here's a useful tip."},{"start":681,"text":"Try not to say um uh ah."},{"start":687,"text":"You can fill it"},{"start":688,"text":"with silence."},{"start":691,"text":"Here's an example with the word book."},{"start":697,"text":"Right. 1-minute timer."},{"start":699,"text":"Start."},{"start":701,"text":"This is a book."},{"start":704,"text":"And"},{"start":705,"text":"I bought it recently"},{"start":708,"text":"when I was traveling"},{"start":710,"text":"in Hanoi"},{"start":712,"text":"with my Uncle Lee"},{"start":714,"text":"and my partner"},{"start":715,"text":"Chang."},{"start":717,"text":"I bought this Vietnamese picture"},{"start":720,"text":"dictionary because"},{"start":722,"text":"I love to learn languages."},{"start":726,"text":"I already speak French and Spanish."},{"start":731,"text":"And now"},{"start":733,"text":"I want to learn Vietnamese."},{"start":736,"text":"So"},{"start":737,"text":"I read this book every single day."},{"start":742,"text":"I also"},{"start":744,"text":"read this book to"},{"start":746,"text":"understand the mindset of a language"},{"start":749,"text":"learner."},{"start":750,"text":"So"},{"start":752,"text":"as a teacher, I can help people in a"},{"start":755,"text":"better way."},{"start":757,"text":"I can help people learn English more"},{"start":760,"text":"effectively."},{"start":762,"text":"Oh."},{"start":763,"text":"Time's up."},{"start":765,"text":"And stop."},{"start":768,"text":"So, notice that I didn't say um"},{"start":773,"text":"uh"},{"start":774,"text":"Instead"},{"start":776,"text":"I paused."},{"start":777,"text":"It's okay to pause."},{"start":780,"text":"And if you guys want to make this"},{"start":782,"text":"exercise even more powerful then"},{"start":786,"text":"for the brave ones, you can take your"},{"start":788,"text":"phone"},{"start":790,"text":"record yourself"},{"start":792,"text":"for 1 minute"},{"start":794,"text":"and watch it back afterwards."},{"start":798,"text":"Recording yourself gives you direct"},{"start":800,"text":"feedback and it is really going to"},{"start":803,"text":"improve your English speaking."},{"start":807,"text":"If you practice this exercise every day,"},{"start":809,"text":"I promise you you will get fluent in"},{"start":812,"text":"English."},{"start":814,"text":"Now to summarize how to talk about your"},{"start":816,"text":"hobbies. You can say, \"I like"},{"start":820,"text":"I enjoy"},{"start":822,"text":"I'm into"},{"start":824,"text":"or I'm a big fan of.\""},{"start":828,"text":"How to ask someone else about their"},{"start":830,"text":"hobbies? You can say,"},{"start":832,"text":"\"What do you do for fun?"},{"start":835,"text":"What are you into?\""},{"start":836,"text":"And after they respond, you can say,"},{"start":839,"text":"\"How did you get into that?\""},{"start":842,"text":"And finally, the jam game."},{"start":844,"text":"Pick any word or topic."},{"start":847,"text":"Speak for 1 minute."},{"start":849,"text":"Try not to say \"um, uh, ah.\""},{"start":853,"text":"And if you're brave, you can record"},{"start":855,"text":"yourself on your phone."},{"start":859,"text":"Thank you"},{"start":860,"text":"for watching this video."},{"start":862,"text":"I hope that it helped you."},{"start":865,"text":"And if you want to"},{"start":867,"text":"level up your English even more, you can"},{"start":871,"text":"practice speaking about hobbies with J"},{"start":875,"text":"I."},{"start":876,"text":"Click the link in the description to"},{"start":878,"text":"find out more."},{"start":880,"text":"Have a beautiful day."}]}